# Testing Standards

## Unit tests (required per feature PRD)
- Pure domain: change detection, impact rules, lineage lookup, adaptive rules (later), permissions.
- No real LLM, S3, or Rabbit in unit tests — use fakes/mocks.
- Name: `methodOrBehavior_condition_expectedResult`.

## Integration
- Testcontainers for PostgreSQL (and Rabbit when testing consumers).
- Contract: async job idempotency (double delivery → no duplicate sync events).

## AI
- Golden fixtures for structured JSON parse/validate.
- Never assert on live model prose quality in CI unit tests.

## Coverage expectation
Domain/sync/lineage modules: high coverage. Controllers: thin smoke + validation tests.
